Bagel-Robotics-1 private release preparation.

The exposed training workflows include dataset selection, mask learning without
K/V-matching loss, physical pruning, and recovery without K/V-matching loss.
Recovery starts from checkpoint 55. The evaluated checkpoint1000 and the
separate no-K/V mask-learning experiment retain their distinct provenance.

Preserved implementation components retain their original file headers and
licenses. See LICENSE, THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and LICENSES/. The internal vpp2
namespace is retained for compatibility with the recorded source identities.

Large model/optimizer weights, dataset videos and credentials are external.
Small ranking tensors and generated text conditioning are included with hashes.
The repository is intended to remain private until the owner authorizes release.
